{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05678","headline":"立秋日题安昌寺北山亭 · 孙逖","name":"立秋日题安昌寺北山亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"楼观倚长霄，登攀及霁朝。\n高如石门顶，胜拟赤城标。\n天路云虹近，人寰气象遥。\n山围伯禹庙，江落伍胥潮。\n徂暑迎秋薄，凉风是日飘。\n果林余苦李，萍水覆甘蕉。\n览古嗟夷漫，凌空爱泬寥。\n更闻金刹下，钟梵晚萧萧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孙逖","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05678.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05678","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}